WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.000
Every light, ring and colour in ONE. In about a minute. Then you will read your business at a glance.

00:04.500 --> 00:08.800
ONE is breathing. The gold ONE in the middle slowly breathes. That is Pulse, awake and watching your whole business. Tap it any time to meet Pulse.

00:09.300 --> 00:13.600
Pulsing red: right now. Overdue or urgent. Tom's follow-up is three days late. Do this first.

00:14.100 --> 00:18.400
Pulsing yellow: today. Needs your attention today. Sarah's call is due. Not on fire yet, but it will be.

00:18.900 --> 00:24.000
The number: follow the pulse. Every orb above a pulse pulses too, with how many inside need you. ONE MOVE 2, Follow-ups 2, then the person. Keep tapping the pulse.

00:24.500 --> 00:28.600
A still green ring: all good. Amy is touched this month. Nothing here needs you. Everything is in order.

00:29.100 --> 00:33.400
Gold glow: a special day. Jen's birthday is today. Birthdays, anniversaries and home anniversaries glow gold and come first.

00:33.900 --> 00:38.000
A blinking gold dot: an opportunity. Not urgent, but worth a look. A chance Pulse spotted for you.

00:38.500 --> 00:42.600
A ring that spreads once: it changed. Something changed since you were last here. It rings out one time when you arrive.

00:43.100 --> 00:47.600
A light flying into ONE: it just happened. A box ticked in ONE GO, a visitor at an open house, a buyer's answer. It travels into ONE the moment it happens.

00:48.100 --> 00:52.400
Lights running along the lines. Every few seconds Pulse checks every connection. Nothing to do. It is just working.

00:52.900 --> 00:57.000
The arc around an orb: how far along. It fills as you go. 14 of 25 VIP touches done this month.

00:57.500 --> 01:01.600
A faded orb: not in your package. Faded products are not in your package yet. Tap one to see what it adds.

01:02.100 --> 01:07.400
Faces frost when they go cold. Faces cool as days pass without a touch and frost over once overdue. A gold heartbeat marks Pulse's three for today; embers rise behind anyone who just moved up.

01:07.900 --> 01:13.000
Your VIP-50 and VIP-100, in rings. Gold inner ring is the VIP-50, teal outer ring the VIP-100. The ring round each face is their monthly touches; a red glow means overdue.

01:13.500 --> 01:18.800
Touches fill up. Offers wear gold. The Touch Audit fills with this month's coverage. In the Rolodex, a gold dotted ring is an offer for your clients; a teal dot means you shared it.

01:19.300 --> 01:23.800
A gold badge: someone in here needs you. Tap the group, then the person. Their whole life opens round them.

01:24.300 --> 01:29.000
Red: now. Yellow: today. Green: all good. Follow the pulse.
